as you say it does").

That said, honestly, I'm tired of talking about pudding farming.  This
is one of the classic "neverending topics" that comes up far too often
in places like this, similar to the old C64 v. Apple, Amiga v. everyone,
Mac v. PC wars, etc.  I would much prefer to spend my time either coding
spork or responding to/discussing spork, and so I agree; let's go do
something else.

